WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.120
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Hong Kong martial arts action-comedy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:15.920
film called “Snake in the Eagle's Shadow.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.880
The snake fist clan specializes in the&nbsp;
Snake-style of fighting in kung fu. For&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.840
the past hundred years, the snake fist clan&nbsp;
has had a rivalry with the eagle claw clan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.560
that specializes in eagle-style fighting.&nbsp;
The Eagle clan has made it its mission to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:38.560
kill every single member of the snake clan and&nbsp;
remove the style of fighting altogether. 
&nbsp;

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:43.200
At the beginning of the movie, one of the last&nbsp;
surviving members of the snake clan is challenged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:48.960
by Sheng Kuan, an eagle claw master. The two&nbsp;
battle using their respective style of fighting,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.960
but the eagle claw is evidently&nbsp;
more powerful than the snake fist.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:59.280
Sheng Kuan vows to kill his opponent and end the&nbsp;
snake fist’s legacy. However, it is revealed that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:05.600
a snake fist master named Pai is still alive.&nbsp;
Sheng Kuan kills his opponent and goes on in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:12.320
search of his final and only opponent, Pai.
Meanwhile, Pai is living a low life as a beggar.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:18.000
He hardly earns any money and lives off scraps.&nbsp;
One day, while he is sleeping on a hammock made up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.360
of a single rope, someone barges inside the room&nbsp;
and startles him. It turns out that the landlord&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:28.880
has brought a thug to evacuate Pai since he hasn’t&nbsp;
paid the rent in a month. They search around the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:34.560
room for money but find a snake instead. When they&nbsp;
are distracted, Pai swiftly grabs his rice bowl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:40.560
and a pair of chopsticks and runs outside. He is&nbsp;
surrounded and attacked by a gang. Using the bowl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:45.600
and chopsticks, Pai defends himself without much&nbsp;
effort. Even though his opponents carry knives,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.400
his chopsticks are able to overpower them.
One of the thugs bumps into an eagle claw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:56.080
member Su Chen while trying to run after Pai.&nbsp;
When the thug describes Pai, Su Chen realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.880
that they just encountered a snake fist&nbsp;
member but by then, Pai is long lost. 
&nbsp;

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:05.200
Following that, we are introduced to&nbsp;
the protagonist of the movie, Chien Fu.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:10.400
He is an orphan adopted by a short-tempered&nbsp;
eccentric Kung Fu teacher named Li. 
&nbsp;

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:15.680
Li profits by scamming innocent students,&nbsp;
promising to be a Kung Fu expert when his skills&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:21.360
are merely average. He frequently abuses Chien&nbsp;
Fu physically and makes him do all the cleaning.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:25.280
Chien Fu wants to learn to fight but&nbsp;
even though he works in a Kung Fu school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:30.240
he is never given the opportunity to train. 
One morning, Li is resting while the students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:34.480
practice as usual. Chien Fu watches them&nbsp;
and tries mimicking their movements,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:39.600
forgetting to sweep the floor. Li notices hits&nbsp;
him with a stick. To trouble the kid, even more,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:44.560
he walks around with white powder under his&nbsp;
shoes, making him sweep the floor twice. 
&nbsp;

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:51.040
Later, Li uses Chien Fu as a prop to teach his&nbsp;
students a new form of fighting. He orders Chien&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:56.640
Fu to not dodge the attacks and beats him up as&nbsp;
an example. This is not the first time he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:02.240
used Chien Fu to make himself look like a Kung Fu&nbsp;
expert. Chien Fu is frequently beaten up but he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:07.440
has no other way to make a living. The only person&nbsp;
who sympathizes with him is the school’s cook when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:12.560
even offers to apply medicine to his wounds.
Somewhere else, Pai ends up in front of another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:18.400
Kung Fu school in the town and decides to take&nbsp;
a rest. Inside, a wealthy businessman and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:23.760
overweight son Laap-ban have come to check if the&nbsp;
school is good enough for Laap-ban’s admission.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:28.400
The headteacher boasts about his trainees&nbsp;
being the best in the town but Laap-ban is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:33.120
not convinced. He asks a student to break&nbsp;
a stack of three bricks with a single blow.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:38.320
The student does as told and manages to break them&nbsp;
all. But as soon as he is out of Laap-ban’s sight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:43.760
he yells in pain while holding his hand that&nbsp;
is now starting to turn blue. Moments later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:48.480
Laap-ban tries to shake his hand and realizes&nbsp;
that he was only pretending to be tough.
&nbsp;

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:54.320
The father and son leave to get admission to Li’s&nbsp;
school instead. After that, the students see Pai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:59.840
resting outside and take their frustration out&nbsp;
by beating him up. Pai doesn’t defend himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:04.480
afraid that someone might notice his presence.&nbsp;
Chien Fu sees this and stops them from hurting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:09.280
the poor old man. When the students attack&nbsp;
him, Pai uses his tricks to make Chien Fu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:14.400
fight. He stands behind Chien Fu and pushes him&nbsp;
around so that he can dodge the attacks. 
&nbsp;

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:20.240
During the fight, a Russian religious Missionary&nbsp;
notices Pai and rushes towards him. In reality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:26.000
he is a spy who has been appointed by the eagle&nbsp;
claw clan to find and eliminate the last surviving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:31.680
member of the snake clan. Pai notices him and runs&nbsp;
away with Chien Fu before he can be caught. 
&nbsp;

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:37.440
Following that, Chien Fu brings Pai to the school&nbsp;
and makes tea for him. He also asks the old man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:43.520
to stay the night because he must be injured. Pai&nbsp;
is impressed by his kindness. Meanwhile, Laap-ban&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.960
and his father are in a meeting with Li who boasts&nbsp;
about his training. Laap-ban doesn’t believe him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:54.160
and asks them to break three stacked bricks. Li&nbsp;
laughs at him, stating that he can show them a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:59.520
real fight instead of mere bricks breaking.
He calls Chien Fu and orders him to take the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:04.320
beating from one of his students. An excited&nbsp;
Laap-ban watches as the fight starts. Chien&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:09.920
Fu is beaten up yet again but he cannot dodge the&nbsp;
attacks, scared that he will have to starve the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:15.520
next day. By the end of it, Laap-ban is impressed&nbsp;
by Chien Fu’s opponent’s skills and agrees to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:21.040
admission to the school. Chien Fu walks back to&nbsp;
Pai with several cuts and bruises on his face.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:26.400
Embarrassed, he runs to his room. The cook tells&nbsp;
Pai that it is a daily thing for Chien Fu to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:31.200
beaten up. He is used as a display dummy&nbsp;
to maintain the school’s reputation.
&nbsp;

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:36.400
To lighten his mood, Pai places a bowl on his&nbsp;
head and asks him to try and get it. Chien Fu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:41.360
does his best but Pai is so skilled that he&nbsp;
doesn’t let him get a single touch of the bowl.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:46.880
The following morning Chien Fu wakes up to see&nbsp;
Pai is missing. He notices a message on the wall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:52.080
that vaguely talks about the dodging skill.&nbsp;
Outside, Pai has also drawn a pattern of footsteps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:57.520
for Chien Fu to follow and learn the tricks from&nbsp;
yesterday. In reality, the tricks were the basics&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:01.280
of the snake fist technique. 
Using the message and the steps,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:06.000
Chien Fu comprehends what Pai is trying&nbsp;
to teach him and starts practicing. He is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:11.200
a gifted fighter and learns the technique in a&nbsp;
short period of time. Somewhere else, Pai bumps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:16.320
into the Russian missionary and follows him to&nbsp;
find out his true intentions. However, he soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:22.240
realizes it is a trap when Su Chen of the eagle&nbsp;
claw stops him and challenges him to a fight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:28.560
The missionary and Su Chen go against Pai but he&nbsp;
manages to flee after tricking them. However, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:34.000
is left severely injured after the commotion.
At the same time, Laap-ban's father comes to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.800
school to check his son’s progress. Li asks&nbsp;
Chien Fu to take beatings from Laap-ban,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:45.040
wanting to use him as a dummy yet again. But this&nbsp;
time, using Pai’s techniques, Chien Fu dodges all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:50.480
the attacks. He even makes Laap-ban bump into&nbsp;
his father, making both fall to the ground.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:56.000
In the end, Laap-ban and his father run away&nbsp;
to the other school. An angered Li hits Chien&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:00.640
Fu repeatedly for humiliating him.
Chien Fu runs away from the school and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:06.000
coincidentally bumps into an injured Pai. He&nbsp;
takes him to a shed and dresses his wounds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:12.000
Somewhere else Su Chen meets the higher official&nbsp;
of the eagle claw clan, Shang Kuan, and tells him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:18.000
everything about his encounter with Pai. Then, we&nbsp;
see Chien Fu taking care of Pai until gets better.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.400
After finding out that Chien Fu was able to&nbsp;
learn the technique only through the drawings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:28.240
Pai agrees to train him in snake-style kung&nbsp;
fu. His only condition is that Chien Fu won’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:33.040
call him “master”, won’t use the training&nbsp;
to display violence, and won’t interfere&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:37.520
when Pai is fighting his opponents.
Chien Fu accepts all the conditions and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:42.800
the training. He works hard day and night and&nbsp;
learns the techniques in no time. Over the weeks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:48.320
Pai gives him more difficult tasks but he shows&nbsp;
growth and perseverance like no other. 
&nbsp;

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:53.440
One day, he is lazily sweeping the floor in the&nbsp;
school when Li sees him and decides to trouble&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:59.200
him as always. He steps on white powder but before&nbsp;
he can step on the floor, Chien Fu slides the mop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:05.120
under his feet. Li tries his best to trick Chien&nbsp;
Fu but he is quicker because of the training. As&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:09.840
they are struggling, a group from the rival school&nbsp;
barges in. The leader of the group is the new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:15.280
three Provinces Champ in Kung Fu. He is furious&nbsp;
because all other schools in the town sent him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:21.280
gifts to show respect but Li didn’t do so. 
Hence, he challenges Li and his fellow teacher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:26.080
to a match. Li is reluctant but since all&nbsp;
his students are watching, he has no way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:30.560
but to accept. The state champion doesn’t&nbsp;
waste time before beating them both up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:35.200
proving that they are just a bunch of frauds&nbsp;
who only know basic knowledge about Kung Fu.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.360
Chien Fu wants to help them but since he has&nbsp;
promised Pai that he will only use his skills&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:43.840
for defense, he stays out of the fight. 
After the two are defeated, the students follow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:48.880
the state champion to the rival school. Later that&nbsp;
day, Chien Fu is cleaning when the former teacher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:54.880
of the school, master Hang returns from a trip.&nbsp;
He used to be the headteacher until Li took over.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:59.440
Enraged that they were defeated by the opponents,&nbsp;
he walks to the rival school and challenges&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:04.480
the state champion. They get into an intense&nbsp;
fight, both matching in skills. But in the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:10.000
the state champion beats master Hang and still&nbsp;
doesn’t stop attacking him. Chien Fu finally steps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:15.680
in which angers the champion even more. He attacks&nbsp;
him a couple of times, asking him to fight back.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:20.960
Now that Chien Fu can use his training as defense,&nbsp;
he doesn’t hold back and starts battling him. 
&nbsp;

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:26.240
Everyone is shocked to see that a mere janitor&nbsp;
is giving the state champion a hard time. Master&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:31.120
Hang is just as surprised because he didn’t know&nbsp;
Chien Fu could fight. From the entrance door,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:36.000
Sheng Kuan is also watching them. He sees&nbsp;
Chien Fu’s technique and recognizes it as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:41.520
the snake fist technique. Since only one person&nbsp;
from the clan is alive, he is sure that Chien&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:46.160
Fu knows Pai. After defeating the champion,&nbsp;
Chien Fu and Hang return to their school. 
&nbsp;

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:51.360
At home, Chien Fu finds a letter by Pai that says&nbsp;
he will be gone for a few days. Alongside the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:56.960
letter is a book on snake-style fighting. Chien&nbsp;
Fu rushes to the shed to see Pai but the old man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:03.040
has already left. Just then, Sheng Kuan who had&nbsp;
been tailing him till now inquires if he knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:09.200
Pai. When Chien Fu affirms, Sheng Kuan lies about&nbsp;
being Pai’s friend and asks Chien Fu to tell him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:14.400
when he returns from his trip. He also emphasizes&nbsp;
to keep his arrival a secret from Pai because he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:20.080
wants to surprise his old friend. A naive Chien&nbsp;
Fu believes him and agrees to help him.
&nbsp;

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:25.120
On reaching home, he sees his pet cat fighting&nbsp;
a snake. Even though at first glance, the snake&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:30.000
looks more dangerous, it is proven to be weak&nbsp;
against the cat’s paws. This gives Chien Fu an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:35.840
idea to mix the paw technique with the snake&nbsp;
fist technique to make it more dangerous. 
&nbsp;

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:40.800
Somewhere else, Pai returns to the town&nbsp;
and is immediately confronted by Su Chen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:46.960
At first, Su Chen pretends to be dead and attacks&nbsp;
him with a knife. He believes Pai was stabbed but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:51.600
turns out he was ready to dodge the attack.&nbsp;
They get into a fight where Pai overpowers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:56.720
him with his expertise and kills him.
Following that, he goes to meet Chien Fu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:02.000
who is overjoyed to have him back. They ask&nbsp;
the cook for tea but the man mixes poison in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:07.600
it. Just then, Chien Fu remembers Sheng Kuan and&nbsp;
rushes to tell him about Pai’s arrival. But when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:12.560
they return looking for him, Pai has already&nbsp;
fled. Sheng Kuan predicts where he is heading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:17.520
and runs after him as Chien Fu follows them. 
On his way, Chien Fu is stopped by the Russian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:21.920
Missionary who wants to kill him. They get into&nbsp;
a fight where the missionary has an upper hand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:27.200
because of his sword. Chien Fu gets his clothes&nbsp;
torn but still manages to defeat him in the end.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:32.560
Somewhere else, Pai meets Sheng Kuan. He has&nbsp;
had enough of running and wants to fight to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:37.600
put an end to the century-long rivalry between&nbsp;
their clans. The fight starts and initially,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:42.480
they seem to match in expertise. But Sheng&nbsp;
Kuan soon overpowers him and is about to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:47.920
kill him when Chien Fu interrupts them.
To save his master, he asks Sheng Kuan to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:53.040
fight him instead. Pai tries to stop Chien Fu,&nbsp;
knowing that he is not trained enough to defeat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:59.120
Sheng Kuan but he doesn’t back down. Soon, they&nbsp;
launch at each other and Chien Fu immediately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:04.000
manages to scratch his opponent’s face with&nbsp;
his new invention; the cat claw technique.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:08.800
By the mixture of the snake fist and cat&nbsp;
claw, he creates a unique deadly technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:14.320
that defeats the eagle claws in no time.&nbsp;
In the end, Sheng Kuan is also defeated.
&nbsp;

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:20.000
As the master and student are about to leave, the&nbsp;
cook approaches them and tries to stab Chien Fu.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:25.600
Pai stops him effortlessly and inquires why he&nbsp;
is doing this. It turns out that he is also a spy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:29.920
from the eagle claw clan. He laughs knowing&nbsp;
that they are about to die of the poison he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:35.200
gave them earlier, but Chien Fu reveals that he&nbsp;
had exchanged the tea because it was too hot.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:40.400
In the last scene, the cook remembers that he&nbsp;
drank the poisoned tea. The poison’s effect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:46.720
starts to show and he dies instantly. In the last&nbsp;
scene, Pai compliments Chien Fu for inventing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:56.640
such a powerful new technique. 
